      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai36/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001000000.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">いつも ①<u><ruby>電子<rp>(</rp><rt>でんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>辞書<rp>(</rp><rt>じしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></u>を <ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って いるんですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Lúc nào cũng mang kim từ điển theo à?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ええ。②<u><ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい ことばを <ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた</u>ら、③<u>すぐ <ruby>意味<rp>(</rp><rt>いみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>調<rp>(</rp><rt>しら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べられる</u>ように、<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って いるんです。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng. Mang theo để khi nghe từ nào mới thì có thể nhanh chóng tra được ý nghĩa.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">そうですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vậy à?</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"